WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.425 --> 00:00:02.568
- Hi, I'm Lana Condor
and I play Lara Jean.

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:05.109
- And I'm Noah Centineo
and I play Peter Kavinsky.

00:00:05.109 --> 00:00:07.648
- And I'm Israel Broussard
and I play Josh Anderson.

00:00:07.648 --> 00:00:10.008
- We're going to find out
which characters we are--

00:00:10.008 --> 00:00:11.855
- From To All the Boys I've Loved Before.

00:00:11.855 --> 00:00:13.355
- Only on Netflix.

00:00:13.721 --> 00:00:16.304
(upbeat music)

00:00:17.552 --> 00:00:19.850
- So choose a carb to
bring to the bake sale.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.611
We've got cookies, always a nice option.

00:00:22.611 --> 00:00:24.237
Cupcakes.
- [Lana] Yum.

00:00:24.237 --> 00:00:25.633
- [Israel] Brownies.
- [Lana] Yes.

00:00:25.633 --> 00:00:26.764
- [Israel] Donuts.

00:00:26.764 --> 00:00:29.755
Muffins and last but not least, pie.

00:00:29.755 --> 00:00:30.713
I'm going to go with the brownies

00:00:30.713 --> 00:00:32.496
because chocolate never fails.

00:00:32.496 --> 00:00:33.402
- I want good cupcakes

00:00:33.402 --> 00:00:35.106
'cause then you can cut
them in half, flip them,

00:00:35.106 --> 00:00:35.939
and have a cupcake sandwich--

00:00:35.939 --> 00:00:37.047
- Be your own person, Lana.

00:00:37.047 --> 00:00:37.880
- I'm gonna--

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:38.846
- You're gonna, oh.

00:00:38.846 --> 00:00:40.933
- I'm like trying to cheat (laughs).

00:00:40.933 --> 00:00:42.359
No, I'm going with pie.

00:00:42.359 --> 00:00:45.913
Your friend cancels plans
last minute on a Friday night.

00:00:45.913 --> 00:00:47.580
What is your plan B?

00:00:47.907 --> 00:00:50.240
Stay home and watch a movie.

00:00:50.365 --> 00:00:53.087
Text your other friends
to see what they're up to.

00:00:53.087 --> 00:00:55.531
Go to a coffee shop to
quietly read a book.

00:00:55.531 --> 00:00:58.042
Head to your favorite hang out spot.

00:00:58.042 --> 00:01:01.103
Text your crush and see if
they want to grab dinner.

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:03.919
Or go to the gym for a quick
workout. That's not mine.

00:01:03.919 --> 00:01:05.175
- I'm gonna say hang out spot.

00:01:05.175 --> 00:01:07.025
- I'm gonna go to a coffee
shop and read a book.

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:07.858
That's what--

00:01:07.858 --> 00:01:09.100
- And hopefully get stared at.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.239
Stay at home and watch a movie.
Probably a movie on Netflix.

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:13.290
(ding ding)

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:16.285
- Which accessory would you
purchase for your bedroom?

00:01:16.285 --> 00:01:17.535
This fun quilt.

00:01:18.186 --> 00:01:20.019
These bold plant pots.

00:01:20.433 --> 00:01:23.100
These statement wall tapestries.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:25.646
This beautiful candle, this cute planner,

00:01:25.646 --> 00:01:27.313
or this pastel lamp.

00:01:27.836 --> 00:01:29.690
- (stammering)

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:30.523
- Pastel.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.417
- You said pastel

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:35.143
Like, you made it sound so regal.

00:01:35.143 --> 00:01:37.526
- I mean, pastel in it's own rite,

00:01:37.526 --> 00:01:38.359
is very,

00:01:38.916 --> 00:01:39.749
- Regal.

00:01:39.749 --> 00:01:40.582
- Right on.

00:01:40.582 --> 00:01:41.893
- I'm gonna go with the fun quilt.

00:01:41.893 --> 00:01:43.810
Keep warm, looks comfy.

00:01:44.011 --> 00:01:44.957
- I love candles.

00:01:44.957 --> 00:01:46.025
- But what does it smell like?

00:01:46.025 --> 00:01:47.820
- But this candle, it's like a light blue

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.289
which means it's probably sweet,

00:01:49.289 --> 00:01:50.530
and I don't like sweet candles.

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:51.697
- What do you,

00:01:51.699 --> 00:01:52.532
- I want like a--

00:01:52.532 --> 00:01:53.365
- Hint of lavender?

00:01:53.365 --> 00:01:54.563
- Like a dark rum... smelling

00:01:54.563 --> 00:01:56.269
- Oh okay so more of like a

00:01:56.269 --> 00:01:57.102
- Woodsy.

00:01:57.732 --> 00:01:59.806
- I'm gonna go with these bold plant pots

00:01:59.806 --> 00:02:01.579
because even if there wasn't a plant in it

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:02.900
you could still use it for like

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.067
- Keys, change

00:02:04.162 --> 00:02:05.245
- Pasta, soup

00:02:06.017 --> 00:02:06.850
- Okay

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.020
- Pick an emoji that speaks to your soul

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:10.887
- I can't even do the flat face.

00:02:10.887 --> 00:02:12.915
And then it's the kissy face.

00:02:12.915 --> 00:02:14.339
And then it's the cry eyes

00:02:14.339 --> 00:02:15.587
- That's not crying, that's laughing.

00:02:15.587 --> 00:02:16.420
- But he's crying while he's laughing

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:17.253
- Have you never used--

00:02:17.253 --> 00:02:18.843
- I use that one all the time

00:02:18.843 --> 00:02:20.487
I understand where I messed up.

00:02:20.487 --> 00:02:21.573
- The crying eyes...

00:02:21.573 --> 00:02:22.495
- The crying eyes is this one.

00:02:22.495 --> 00:02:23.328
Like the--

00:02:23.548 --> 00:02:25.127
With the tears going down like this.

00:02:25.127 --> 00:02:27.478
- With the stream, it's the
steady, like, waterfall.

00:02:27.478 --> 00:02:28.311
- Waterfall.

00:02:28.311 --> 00:02:29.483
- You're right. Alright? I'm wrong.

00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:30.374
Is that what you wanted to hear?

00:02:30.374 --> 00:02:31.207
- Yes.

00:02:31.207 --> 00:02:33.290
- I want the glasses one.

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.374
- [Israel] So out of these
six, let's just label all--

00:02:35.374 --> 00:02:36.629
- [Lana] Okay... you right, you right.

00:02:36.629 --> 00:02:37.880
- I'm gonna go with the cry face.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.297
Slash laugh face.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:40.977
- Bottom left.

00:02:43.936 --> 00:02:45.825
- I'm gonna go with this
one. That's just like...

00:02:45.825 --> 00:02:46.827
- The top one? The first one?

00:02:46.827 --> 00:02:47.660
Just the flat--

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.493
- 'Cause I feel like that's like,

00:02:48.493 --> 00:02:51.412
I think I live my life
like, a little scared

00:02:51.412 --> 00:02:53.877
and a little confused. And I think

00:02:53.877 --> 00:02:55.560
this one really speaks to me.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:56.860
And a little dead inside.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:57.693
- You look hopeless.

00:02:57.693 --> 00:03:00.126
- That is true. Just a little terrified.

00:03:00.126 --> 00:03:01.628
(fake crying)

00:03:01.628 --> 00:03:03.155
- Which song are you going to jam out to

00:03:03.155 --> 00:03:05.297
on your drive home from school?

00:03:05.297 --> 00:03:07.630
"Girls Like You" by Maroon 5

00:03:07.646 --> 00:03:09.896
"Attention" by Charlie Puth

00:03:10.474 --> 00:03:12.557
"In My Feelings" By Drake

00:03:12.705 --> 00:03:13.538
Which one is that?

00:03:13.538 --> 00:03:14.371
- Kiki, do you love me?

00:03:14.371 --> 00:03:15.204
- Okay

00:03:15.745 --> 00:03:17.578
"One Kiss" by Dua Lupa

00:03:17.884 --> 00:03:19.928
"Sit Next To Me" by Foster The People

00:03:19.928 --> 00:03:21.522
